			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a104" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts206" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts207">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I would explain that although I guess I don't know if I exactly said that to her, but to my mind it's particularly interesting not because she's one of a series of women that he had affairs with, but because it was in effect the thing that made Maria move out and they nearly they came very very close to divorcing.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
