				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>And just recently his son still lives in the house on Michigan Avenue and he took we went someplace and he showed me the way Tarski used to go or either he drove no I think I drove, but he showed me how Tarski used to do it, which was that way.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
